        <mxCell id="domain-relationships-note" value="&amp;lt;b&amp;gt;Links to Domain Model&amp;lt;/b&amp;gt;&amp;lt;hr align='left'/&amp;gt;Attendant uses ParkingService. ParkingService manages ParkingLot and ParkingSession. ReservationService uses ParkingLot and manages Reservation. PaymentService charges ParkingSession, uses Rate, and records Payment. CompatibilityPolicy is used by Vehicle and ParkingLot. ConsoleMain also creates the demo ParkingLot and Rates." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=13;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
